@startuml
title Leon Bookings - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Administrator" as Admin
component "React frontend\n(Vite build)" as UI
component "Spring Boot\nREST API + security" as API
component "Booking services" as Services
database "SQLite" as DB
component "Desktop launcher\n(optional)" as Launcher

Admin --> UI
UI --> API : HTTP / JSON\nsession + CSRF
API --> Services
Services --> DB : bookings + resources
Launcher --> API : starts local app
Launcher --> Admin : opens browser

note right of UI
Production frontend assets
are served by Spring Boot.
end note
@enduml
